                                        "entry_id": "d9184529-79b4-310d-b193-a0c3d18c02c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various insects in the family Formicidae in the order Hymenoptera, typically living in large colonies composed almost entirely of flightless females."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5551c24-1c9d-4323-8ac0-378a1f375958",
                                                "sense_id": "39293a97-02a5-30e5-8b24-543abbf2af98",
                                                "text": "The San Juan market is Mexico City's most famous deli of exotic meats, where an adventurous shopper can hunt down hard-to-find critters […]. But the priciest items in the market aren't the armadillo steaks or even the bluefin tuna. That would be the frozen chicatanas – giant winged ants – at around $500 a kilo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
